  "q": "A box holds 12 batteries, and some of them are defective. A technician picks 2 batteries at random, one after the other, without replacement. The probability that at least 1 of the 2 batteries picked is defective is <sup>15</sup>&frasl;<sub>22</sub>. How many batteries in the box are defective?",
